<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLISH COUNTY CHAMPIONSHIP CLOSE SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLISH COUNTY CHAMPIONSHIP CLOSE SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores on the first day of four-day English county championship matches on Thursday:</p>
<p>Birmingham (Edgbaston): Warwickshire 50-0 v Sussex.</p>
<p>Worcester: Worcestershire 58-0 v Kent</p>
<p>Leeds (Headingley): Yorkshire 163-9 v Northamptonshire</p>
<p>Colchester: Essex 204-2 (S.Law 124 not out, N.Hussein 52 not out) v Leicestershire</p>
<p>Chester-le-Street: Derbyshire 254 (J.Adams 107; S.Brown 4-63), Durham 109-6</p>
</text>
